    "text": "The given equation is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />or <math><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />On integrating, we get<br />&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>",
